                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Disposal of a ventilation system for a residential care home with apartments, kitchen, cafe/restaurant, multi-purpose hall, laundry and car park. The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 11358 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 74580 m3/h, total weight of the components: 30520 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 6.6 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including components for air handling units, ducts including insulation, air valves, roof-hoods, dampers, fire dampers, silencers. The data represent a ductwork mainly made of galvanized steel and includes air handling units mainly with heat recovery. System with central air handling units. Building without ground heat exchanger.;
UUID: 041e12fb-6361-40ef-9a9f-5e383f3dae12</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
